<body style="background-color:powderblue;"></body>
<html>
<body>

<h2>HTML Tables</h2>

<p>HTML tables start with a table tag.</p>
<p>Table rows start with a tr tag.</p>
<p>Table data start with a td tag.</p>

<hr>
<h2>1 Column:</h2>

<table>
  <tr>
    <td>100</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<hr>
<h2>1 Row and 3 Columns:</h2>
<table>
  <tr>
    <td>100</td>
    <td>200</td>
    <td>300</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<hr>
<h2>3 Rows and 3 Columns:</h2>
<table>
  <tr>
    <td>100</td>
    <td>200</td>
    <td>300</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>400</td>
    <td>500</td>
    <td>600</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>700</td>
    <td>800</td>
    <td>900</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<hr>

</body>
</html>
